@bank all
// EW1 (events writer), Crossing the Line (events plan v3.2, section 3: Sunday Day 7). The event's own words in EV1's
// keys (see content/banks/event-ionStorm.lines). Mail is "Subject | body", unsigned (the warning is Vance's).
// Gatherings: event.crossingLine.gather.<id>.<...>; the ceremony is the meeting crossingCeremony.
== event.crossingLine.mail.warning
- Tomorrow we cross the Line | Tomorrow at 14:30 the Wren crosses into the Veyli reach. The horn will sound on every deck. First crossing? The ceremony is on the plaza, 14:30. Then the Line supper in the mess at 18:00, in place of the Sunday table. Attendance is not required. It is, however, expected.
== event.crossingLine.status.warning
- Tomorrow at 14:30 we cross the Line into the Veyli reach.
// the banner at 14:30, after the horn: the Captain is called in on her day off
== event.crossingLine.address.onset.1
- This is the Captain. I'm off today, so I'll be brief. We've crossed the Line.
== event.crossingLine.address.onset.2
- Welcome to the Veyli reach. Look out of a window. Everything out there is new to us.
== event.crossingLine.address.onset.3
- First-timers, to the plaza. The rest of you, be kind. Marrow out.
== event.crossingLine.status.onset
- We've crossed the Line. Ceremony on the plaza; the Line supper at 18:00.
== event.crossingLine.status.afterglow
- First day in the Veyli reach.
// tap lines on the plaza during the ceremony (crew, not first-timers)
== event.crossingLine.gather.ceremony.here
- Front row's for first-timers. We old hands stand at the back and laugh.   #funny
- Watch their faces when the punch goes round. Best bit.   #funny
- I cried at my first Line. Don't tell anyone.   #warm
// the Line supper, 18:00-19:15, the mess, in place of the Sunday table (an extra batch and a pudding; Brennan is on duty; no cake in the words: the four-weeks cake is the cake moment)
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.name
- The Line supper
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.mail
- The Line supper | The Line supper tonight at six, in the mess, in place of the Sunday table. Whatever the crew voted for, and a pudding. No punch. I promise.
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.ask
- Line supper at six. Proper food, to make up for the punch.   #funny
- Everyone's at the Line supper tonight. Come and find a seat. Or a wall.
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.here
- To the Line, and everyone who crossed it today.   #warm
- Supper's to get rid of the taste. It's working.   #funny
- First-timers eat first. That's the rule tonight.
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.thanks
- The mess is full to the walls. Someone hands you a plate, and someone else saves you a corner of the bench.   #warm
== event.crossingLine.gather.lineSupper.chatter
- Best Sunday table we've had. And it wasn't even the Sunday table.   #funny
- The Line supper ran out of seconds in ten minutes. Brennan was thrilled.
// tap texts: the certificate on your shelf (a keepsake) and the plaque on the plaza (the deck architect's props)
== event.crossingLine.keepsake
- Your Line certificate, signed by the Captain: "Crossed into the Veyli reach, Day 7. This reach knows your name."

// ---- story A, "The one on watch" (event-line plan v2; the user's choice). GUARD RAILS for Tomas (his arc, beats 5
// and 7): only about missing his crossing; nothing about failing, tests, Holt, or staying.
// Saturday, if you don't meet Tomas before his bedtime: his Mail at about 22:50 (unsigned; from Tomas Lind)
== event.crossingLine.mail.tomas
- On watch tomorrow | On watch tomorrow, all day. You'll have to cross for both of us. Tell me everything after.
// the plaque on the plaza (from the night of Day 7), with your answer under the date (flag:line.answer.<answer>);
// .missed when you weren't at the ceremony (a first-timer answered)
== event.crossingLine.plaque.proud
- The CSV Wren crossed the Line into the Veyli reach, Day 7. "We came a long way. We're glad we did."
== event.crossingLine.plaque.watch
- The CSV Wren crossed the Line into the Veyli reach, Day 7. "We crossed together. Even the ones on watch."
== event.crossingLine.plaque.punch
- The CSV Wren crossed the Line into the Veyli reach, Day 7. "Is this the part with the punch?"
== event.crossingLine.plaque.missed
- The CSV Wren crossed the Line into the Veyli reach, Day 7. "We're new, and we're nervous, and we came anyway."
// the missed-it answer, said by a first-timer in the ceremony when you're not there
== event.crossingLine.answer.missed
- We're new, and we're nervous, and we came anyway.
// the Lap (meeting lineLap): Tomas's line to you after Pell's, by your day
== event.crossingLine.lap.tomas.watch
- You said "even the ones on watch". Deck 2 heard about it in five minutes.   #warm
== event.crossingLine.lap.tomas.mug
- I've still got the mug. I'm keeping it. Is that allowed? I'm keeping it.   #warm
== event.crossingLine.lap.tomas.none
- Next Line, you're on watch and I'm drinking the punch. Deal?   #funny
// the punch secret: Brennan, while you carry the punch up from the galley (the volunteer job's first stop)
== event.crossingLine.punch.secret
- What's in it? Pickle brine. One spoon. Every Line since I joined. Tell no one.
// if you promised Tomas punch and didn't go up: Brennan saves him one (at the supper)
== event.crossingLine.punch.saved
- Tomas is on watch, so I've saved him a mug. Don't look at me like that. I'm not soft.
// the horn's one-line notice (14:30, every deck), and the device's notice (14:15, with "show on map")
== event.crossingLine.notice.horn
- The ship's horn: the Wren has crossed the Line.
== event.crossingLine.notice.ceremony
- Crossing the Line: the ceremony on the plaza at 14:30. First-timers to the front.
// the two volunteer jobs (the mess sign-up sheet; Brennan offers them too)
== event.crossingLine.job.punch
- Crossing the Line: carry the punch up from the galley
== event.crossingLine.job.ribbons
- Crossing the Line: hang the gold ribbons on the plaza
// the Record line (never a score)
== event.crossingLine.record
- Crossed the Line into the Veyli reach, Day 7.
